  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening local communities&#x2019; influence over the Truth Commission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to strengthen the impact of the ethnic communities in the Pacific Region and the Caribbean coast on the work of the Truth Commission of Colombia by gathering testimonies from victims and recommendations on how to avoid new conflicts in the future. The mandate of the Truth Commission require gender focus in all its activities.</narrative>
  </description>
